<title>JAPAN: Ricoh shares boosted higher by interim earnings.</title>
<headline>Ricoh shares boosted higher by interim earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ricoh Co Ltd shares were boosted on Thursday morning by the firm's interim earnings, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0129 GMT the shares were up 10 yen, at 1,160. Trading volume was the 10th largest at 804,000 shares.</p>
</text>
